WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.100
Please guide us.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.830
If you say enemies can 
become friends overnight,

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.210
maybe you should throw yourself 
on the ground and apologize, eh?

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.750
Can you manage that, you smug noble?

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.290
This is all I can do now.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:23.960
I swear I shall make amends.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.740
Why are priests and nobles 
so over the top?

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:30.420
Do what you want.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.170
Th-Then...

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:33.920
Well, that was quick.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.840
I don't need you to make 
amends or apologies.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.980
I killed your guys, too. 
It goes both ways.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.950
But no thanks to being your guide.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.420
Not my thing.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.940
I don't know what you want to 
learn, but do what you like.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:51.320
Stay out of my way, 
and I won't interfere.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:52.690
We are grateful.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.570
No need for that yet.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.580
Coming with us means you won't 
be able to sleep at night.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.910
They're coming, Isidoro!

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:04.830
I know!

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.080
Lady Farnese, please keep 
the fire going!

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.340
I... I am ready!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.300
No, Casca!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.530
You cannot wander around!

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.180
Here they come!

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:22.650
Come at me, you ghouls!

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:31.350
<b><i>Forest of Demonic Beasts</i></b>

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.730
Take that...

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:07.420
Oh, tasty!

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:10.370
I tried adding marrow from the 
fox we caught yesterday.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.850
Why?

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.260
Pico, you do good work!

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:16.300
Think of your size. Why hold 
your sword over your head?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.130
If you want to become a 
sellsword, use your brains.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.140
Would you like more salt?

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.140
What if I get brain damage before 
I get the chance to think?

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.760
We did have a workout earlier...

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:26.250
Dropey, it's almost dinnertime.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.200
Get Farnese and Casca will you?

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.520
You guys are getting good at 
this domestic life thing.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.880
Lady Farnese, these are...

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:36.980
Mushrooms.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.030
I found them earlier.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.940
They're poisonous.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.280
We can't eat them.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.780
R-Really?

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.170
Hey! My holiday best!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.160
You can stop. I'll take it from here.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.160
What're you doing?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.920
Never mind. Focus on protecting 
Casca and the fire!

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:03.240
<i>I am so useless.</i>

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.180
<i>It's laughable, really.</i>

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.890
I have been quite cruel to you.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:11.430
I apologize.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:22.440
<i>I never realized my insignificance.</i>

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.580
Casca, please wait a moment.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:34.060
This will add to our provisions, 
at least a bit.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:34.980
Huh?

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:36.510
Damn you.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:39.490
I failed...

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.700
Let us return, Casca.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.040
Casca?

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:51.100
Casca!

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.310
<i>It's... It's my fault!</i>

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.510
Casca!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.750
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.120
<i>I don't even know the way back.</i>

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.050
Cas—

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.260
Someone!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:26.890
Serpico...

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.760
Oh, there she is.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.060
Over here!

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:39.150
Lady Farnese, you're unharmed.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.650
Man, not a care in the world, huh?

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:45.850
And we were all scrambling 
to protect Casca...

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:47.130
Casca!

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.660
Is Casca all right?

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.530
She's more than all right.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.150
Her stomach led her 
back before dinner.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:00.420
Good, we can finally get some sleep.

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.750
Don't cause so much trouble, okay?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.170
Why is the babysitter getting lost?

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.560
Serpico?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:14.930
Yes, my lady?

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.180
I have caused you trouble.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:20.730
What's wrong?

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.680
Nothing, my lady.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.690
Are you returning to the Holy See?

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.580
Who...

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:32.980
Who would go back?

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:42.280
If you're heading to the Port 
of Vritannis, be careful.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:47.180
It's become a garrison 
for the allied forces.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:52.590
I hear the Kushans are about to 
start a major battle there.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.200
Even if the allied forces 
repel the Kushans,

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.110
they'll carve up the kingdom 
amongst themselves.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.490
Midland may even cease to exist...

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.270
Well, not that any of that 
matters to us shepherds.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.050
Are you a Midlander?

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.170
Things must be difficult for you.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:19.070
No, we were only living 
there for a while.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.340
Oh, I just remembered!

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:28.620
Beware if you're taking that path,

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:31.040
especially around the pass.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.230
What the hell, Gramps?

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:33.890
Are you saying bandits are about?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:37.210
That wouldn't be so bad,

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.930
but what's out and about 
aren't human folk.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.520
They're trolls!

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.800
Trolls?

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.760
Shit...

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:52.350
How can I land one hit on Guts?

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.550
Wouldn't you have better 
luck throwing stones?

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.630
Unless I use the sword, it's pointless.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:01.170
Your skills with rocks aren't bad, though.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.320
Well, sure.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.630
Got meat.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:11.420
A double throw, huh? Clever.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:29.400
Ow!

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.540
Shit! That didn't work, either!

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:35.610
Not bad.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.880
You were doing well that time.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.640
But if you always attack from below, 
the opponent will anticipate you.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.990
You need to figure out how 
to be less predictable.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.580
About your last attack,

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.180
you should aim for gaps in the armor.

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:52.110
You're not strong enough to pierce it.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.470
I see...

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.060
Hey, is this good enough?

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.050
What?

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.570
Isn't training usually

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:05.350
practicing basics for a long time and 
inheriting techniques and stuff?

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.600
You're practicing basics every day.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.730
But...

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:11.120
Do you plan to only go into battle

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:14.200
after training for dozens of years and 
becoming a master swordsman?

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.060
That's a pretty long game.

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.710
N-No, I don't!

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.780
Then you need to manage 
with what you have now.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.540
Isn't that what you've been 
doing all this time?

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.510
You are kind to him.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:32.800
If it isn't too much trouble, could you 
help me gather firewood?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:49.230
Well, these are a little damp...

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.380
Let's just get down to it.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.680
What do you mean?

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.270
Drop the act.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:58.240
You wanted privacy, so we 
could finish the duel.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.140
What are you talking about?

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:03.740
I wanted to get to know 
you better. That's all.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.240
Have a heart-to-heart.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:05.980
Huh?

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.730
You aren't making any sense!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.500
If you don't want to fight, I'm off.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:16.010
To be completely honest, 
I'd like you to die.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.510
You finally have the same 
look as when we fought.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:23.710
But this is what Lady Farnese wants.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.770
The look on her face, like a child 
who's just sobbed her heart out.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.620
I've never seen her so vulnerable.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.690
You've changed her.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.570
Well, as long as Lady Farnese chooses 
to continue her journey,

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:41.710
I intend, as her aide, to maintain 
good relations with you.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:44.200
You worry too much.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.960
What the hell?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:48.840
What's going on?

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.770
Hey! Bandits?

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:55.410
All right!

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:56.460
Are you okay?

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.010
He isn't human!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:10:59.890
What?

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:05.970
What the...

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.790
But what's out and about 
aren't human folk.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.230
<i>So this is what he meant!</i>

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.530
<i>I'll handle this.</i>

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:18.440
Oh, my.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.240
He's going to die.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.490
What are you going to do?

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.010
I'm not scared of you...

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:37.780
You rotten monkey!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:38.980
I'll get ya!

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.050
Isidoro!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.020
<i>I... I'm gonna die!</i>

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.370
Berries?

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:01.280
Don't move.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.980
Look all around you.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:09.000
Wh-When'd they show up?

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.150
The rest of you, come here.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.750
Listen to me.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:22.270
No matter what happens, 
do not leave or break this circle.

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:23.550
Wh-What's this?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.690
It's magic!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.280
This is a magical ritual!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.560
Magic?

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:29.310
Then, is she...

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:33.060
That's right. She's a witch, see? A witch.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.160
A fae like me...

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.560
It's been too long!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.980
Hey, who do you think you are?

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.250
<i>Yodo hegh vau hegh.</i>

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.070
<i>Adonai tsabaut.</i>

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.820
<i>Eghehyeh...</i>

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:42.960
<i>Argrah.</i>

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.000
They're everywhere!

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.830
Wh-What the...

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.010
Wow.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.410
What's going on?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.500
I say this with the best of intentions,

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:13.830
but you should leave 
as soon as possible.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.130
N-No need for you to worry.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.940
We're used to monsters like them.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.460
Excuse me, but with your sword skill,

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.150
you won't survive another encounter.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:23.940
What?!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.700
H-Hang on a second, hag!

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.910
Wh-What the...

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.160
These don't belong to no hag.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.420
I mean, there's hardly anything!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.730
You're just a kid?

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.300
Hey, what's wrong?

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.720
Lady Farnese!

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.280
What happened here?

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.770
Well...

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.980
<i>What's with those two?</i>

00:13:56.760 --> 00:14:00.280
<i>It's as if they attract distortions.</i>

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.570
Damn it all...

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.860
That witch girl!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.170
You did well.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.490
You have my thanks.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:12.590
Coming from you, it just 
makes me all itchy.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:17.250
Well, ultimately, the little witch 
saved us, including the monkey.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:23.250
<i>I don't want anything like 
that to happen again.</i>

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:29.980
She's grown quite fond 
of you, Lady Farnese.

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:31.790
Y-You think so?

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.440
Hey! Stop!

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:37.400
Stop it!

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:38.270
Stop!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.880
Stop, I said!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.400
Stop! Hey, stop!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.820
Huh? What?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:51.300
Okay... There you go.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.970
What happened?

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:56.080
We were attacked by trolls.

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:59.910
There were five others with me, 
but everyone else was...

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:03.040
But I can't just return to our village.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:06.690
There's a place I need to go.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:10.930
I am Morgan, of Enoch Village.

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.800
Travelers such as you 
may not know this,

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:19.070
but tales of fae and witches have 
always been told in these parts.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:24.810
Even still, not many of us 
believed those tales.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:28.500
At least, not until that fateful night.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.070
What fateful night?

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:33.570
A band of trolls attacked the village.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:38.050
They came, like something 
out of the pages of a tale,

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.380
appearing from the darkness.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:46.030
Ever since that day, our world 
was changed forever!

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:50.090
It's as if our lives were a lie.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.060
So do you bear a message to your lord?

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:56.900
Our lord has gone to 
Vritannis for battle.

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.850
The fortress is empty.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.470
Even if I took him the news,

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:06.190
I doubt he'd send men because 
he'd think trolls don't exist!

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:08.610
What's your plan, then?

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:11.110
We counter the legend 
with another legend.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:16.620
A witch... That's who we're 
thinking of asking for help.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.770
A witch?

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:23.540
They say a witch's house stands 
deep in this forest.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:27.520
It's said that only those 
invited by the mistress

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.640
of the house are allowed to reach it.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:33.610
Does that mean this forest 
is under a witch's spell?

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:38.040
Wouldn't that mean looking 
for her is pointless?

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.340
From time to time,

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:43.640
children in the village claim 
to have seen the house.

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:48.650
<i>Someone has breached the barrier.</i>

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:51.150
Elementals...

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.230
What is this?

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.860
W-Wow...

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:16.020
I knew it wasn't a dream!

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.310
No one believed me.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:24.140
And after so many years, even I 
thought I had dreamed it.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.400
That witch girl must be here, too!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.150
<i>What is this strange sensation?</i>

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:34.680
Isidoro!

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:35.650
Get away from there!

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:36.810
Huh?

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.600
What?

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.160
What's with the dumb-looking statue?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:47.790
What a laugh! Er, uh...

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.910
Wait... Let me speak to it.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:03.930
Morgan!

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:06.060
That thing won't listen to you!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.720
Stay back, Gramps.

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:17.200
Shit! It regrew its arm!

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:18.750
<i>A ghoul?</i>

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:20.700
<i>Could it serve the apostles?</i>

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:29.780
This is...

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.530
Creepy fucks!

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:40.160
Wh-What's up with them?!

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:47.730
There's no end to them.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:56.050
Hey, look! Look at that man's sword!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.240
No!

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:04.990
That's...

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.040
Everyone,

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.910
the golems have a small doll embedded 
near the symbols on their chests.

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:15.000
Once you remove the dolls, 
they cannot regenerate!

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.010
Oops, they figured it out.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.160
I see.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.630
Now that we know...

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.570
<i>Isidoropkick!</i>

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:25.000
Yes!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.870
What now, Schierke?

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.770
They'll destroy every single one!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.280
I have no choice.

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:32.830
<i>Enough.</i>

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:38.940
Wh-What happened?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.530
They suddenly stopped moving.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.410
I knew it was her!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:51.870
<i>The witch!</i>

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.550
Everyone, this way, please.

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.800
My mistress will see you.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.170
Oh, yeah? Great!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.270
I'll fight her!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:02.470
What will we do?

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.980
We did get an invitation.

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:06.680
Let's go meet this witch.

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:10.560
Wow, this is fun!

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:14.160
It's more like a nest than a house.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.940
I feel like I've turned into a squirrel.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:16.980
You, there.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.620
Don't touch anything on the 
desk without permission.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:20.440
What a kid!

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:23.950
Wait, so you aren't the 
witch people talk about?

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.070
I am Schierke, and I am 
still an apprentice.

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:29.950
I am Ivalera, her guardian.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:33.070
Oh, so you're just a trainee.

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:34.270
I'm Isidoro.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.290
You did quite a number on me!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.230
Thanks to you, I was living in my 
ancestors' shoes for a half day.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.390
That was because you grabbed 
me in a strange manner!

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:43.430
Strange?

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:45.250
Just tell me what you mean.

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.720
I'm only a monkey, so...

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.920
Like I said, a strange manner!

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:50.270
Her boobs.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.150
L-Like I said...

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:53.230
Boobs!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.730
Quit it. It's getting on my nerves.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.500
Anyway, can you take 
us to her already?

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:01.920
The one you call your mistress?

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.240
This way, please.

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.290
I brought them, mistress.

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:13.500
Welcome to the mansion 
of the spirit tree.

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:16.320
Please forgive the discourtesy 
of my apprentice.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.750
She was only concerned for my safety.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.100
So she's the witch?

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:23.100
I totally thought she'd have

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:26.040
a pointy noise and be all shriveled, 
like some monster...

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.450
H-How dare you?

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:29.610
Why, thank you.

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:32.520
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:38.020
Fifty years ago, 
the medicine you gave me

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:41.590
saved my mother from certain death.

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:45.870
I can't believe my eyes... 
You look exactly the same.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.900
I remember you.

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.980
You were the boy from back then.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.530
It has been a while.

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:57.800
You've never taken the life 
of any of my brethren.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:03.280
But if you had, it would have been 
a sin shared by all who serve God.

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:06.810
I would not seek retribution 
from you alone.

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:08.550
<i>How did she know?</i>

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:11.810
As for you two who bear the brand...

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:13.440
How did you know that?

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.610
I am glad I could meet you.

00:22:16.610 --> 00:22:20.290
I have been waiting for you.

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:05.000
<b>She knows about the brand?</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>He is still alive.</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>That's... a brand of sacrifice, isn't it?</b>

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>Schierke, aid them.</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>It's a key, linking the mortal realm and 
the deepest part of the spirit realm.</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:28.290
<b><i>Next Episode 
Spirit Realm</i></b>
